<title>USA: Marsh &amp; McLennan to split stock, raise div.</title>
<headline>Marsh &amp; McLennan to split stock, raise div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc said Wednesday its management will recommend a two-for-one stock split and an 11 percent dividend increase at the company's board meeting later today.</p>
<p>The dividend increase would bring the company's quarterly cash dividend to $1.00 per share from $0.90, excluding the effect of any stock split.</p>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan is an insurance, investment management and consulting services company.</p>
</text>
